COMMENT     REFSEQ INFORMATION: The reference sequence is identical to
            AE016853.1.
            This represents the most recent version of the continually updated
            genome annotations for Pseudomonas syringae pv. tomato strain
            DC3000 by the Pseudomonas-Plant Interaction project. See
            http://www.pseudomonas-syringae.org for the latest updates and
            expanded annotations. We welcome submission through
            www.pseudomonas-syringae.org of any proposed changes. Note that
            locus tags with values greater than PSPTO_5615 represent features
            added subsequent to the initial annotation (06-MAR-2003) and are
            not in sequential order relative to other locus tags.
            The annotation was added by the NCBI Prokaryotic Genome Annotation
            Pipeline (PGAP). Information about PGAP can be found here:
            https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/genome/annotation_prok/
            
